  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4857918aa396e664da4bf6e1e0405844, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level1(1-D)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "\"That doesn\u2019t mean that I don\u2019t still have more to learn. Why not
    give in some of your own input...?\""
  - "Well, I think that most of the lamp collection is based on living things.\r\nAnd
    this sub-collection where I am is inspired by animals, including insects.\r\nOne
    of the museum staff once said that I was an animal, I\u2019d probably be something
    that flies."
  - "In their words, it\u2019s because I\u2019m always \u201Cflying from one thing
    to the next.\u201D\r\nI don\u2019t know if that\u2019s all that useful, though."
  responses: []
